{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2023-04-12 08:30:00', 'title': 'AON APPOINTS SARAH E. SMITH TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DUBLIN , APRIL 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AON PLC (NYSE: AON), A LEADING GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SARAH E. SMITH, A FORMER MEMBER OF THE MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE OF THE GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP, INC., HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE APRIL 15, 2023.'}